      "description": "Gold start, resume, and retry actions.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\"><span>Begin adventure</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
