      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" aria-label=\"Pause dialog visual specimen\"><span class=\"ds-ornament\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 2 7 10-7 10-7-10Z\"/><path d=\"m5 12 7-4 7 4-7 4Z\"/></svg></span><h2>A moment of quiet.</h2><p>The wilds will wait.</p></section>",
